    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Automated reply:\n{{ $('Leads Agent').item.json.output.emailBody }}\n\nReasoning:\n{{ $('Leads Agent').item.json.output.reason }}\n\nUsed knowledge:\n{{ $('Leads Agent').item.json.output.knowledgeDatabase }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an editor. You review a draft intended for a potential client BEFORE it is sent to a person for approval. You do not write or revise - only evaluate.\n\n## Checklist\n* Is every fact in the draft supported by the facts provided in the knowledge base?\n* Does it promise a price, timeline, or discount that is not in the knowledge base?\n* Does it answer the client's actual question?\n* Is the tone professional, without making excessive promises?\n\n\n## Output\n* `approved = false` if ANY of the above conditions is violated.\n* `notes` = specify exactly what was violated, including a quote from the draft. One sentence.\n\nBe very strict about following the rules."
        }
      },
